---
layout: layouts/base.njk
metaTitle: "Acurris Analytical | Rapid Food Safety Test Kits and Sample Preparation in India"
description: "Rapid test kits for mycotoxins, antibiotic residues and milk adulterants, plus QuEChERS, dSPE, SPE and filtration consumables. Technical reply within 48 hours."
pageType: home
---
{%- set kits = categories | whereGroup("kits") %}
{%- set prep = categories | whereGroup("prep") %}
{%- set q = categories | findBySlug("quechers") %}
{%- set articles = collections.articles.slice(0, 3) %}

<section class="home-hero science-surface">
  {% set scienceFieldVariant = "science-field--hero" %}
  {% include "partials/science-field.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap home-hero-grid">
    <div class="home-hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">RELIABLE PRODUCTS FOR ACCURATE RESULTS</p>
      <h1>Analytical Solutions for a Cleaner, Safer World</h1>
      <p class="lead">High-quality analytical consumables and reference materials for environmental, food, pharmaceutical and industrial testing.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/products/" data-cta="hero">Explore Products</a>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/request-quote/">Request a Quote</a>
      </div>

      <div class="home-trust-grid" aria-label="Trust indicators">
        <div class="home-trust-item">
          <strong>Trusted Quality</strong>
          <span>Consistent &amp; reliable results</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-trust-item">
          <strong>Wide Range</strong>
          <span>11+ Product Categories</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-trust-item">
          <strong>Technical Support</strong>
          <span>Expert guidance</span>
        </div>
        <div class="home-trust-item">
          <strong>Pan-India Supply</strong>
          <span>Fast &amp; secure delivery</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-hero-feature">
      <div class="home-hero-media">
        <img src="/assets/img/products/hero-l.webp" srcset="/assets/img/products/hero-m.webp 800w, /assets/img/products/hero-l.webp 1600w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 55vw, 100vw" width="1600" height="1100" alt="Laboratory analytical consumables and sample prep materials" fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
      <div class="home-spotlight">
        <p class="kicker">Featured product</p>
        <h2>{{ q.name }}</h2>
        <p>Pre-weighed formulations for fast, reproducible extraction across multi-residue food and environmental methods.</p>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/products/quechers/">Learn more {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section science-surface home-products-section" aria-labelledby="product-title">
  {% set scienceFieldVariant = "science-field--products" %}
  {% include "partials/science-field.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our products</p>
        <h2 id="product-title">Analytical Products for Every Application</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="arrow-link" href="/products/">View all products {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
    </div>

    <div class="home-product-grid">
      {% for c in categories.slice(0, 7) %}
        <a class="home-product-card{% if loop.first %} home-product-card--feature{% endif %}" href="/products/{{ c.slug }}/">
          <span class="home-product-media">
            <img src="/assets/img/products/{{ c.img }}-m.webp" width="800" height="600" alt="{{ c.name }} analytical product category" loading="lazy">
          </span>
          <span class="home-product-body">
            <strong>{{ c.name }}</strong>
            <span>{{ c.nav }}</span>
          </span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--well home-featured-solution science-surface" aria-labelledby="solution-title">
  {% set scienceFieldVariant = "science-field--solutions" %}
  {% include "partials/science-field.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap home-solution-grid">
    <div class="home-solution-media">
      <img src="/assets/img/products/cat-quechers-l.webp" srcset="/assets/img/products/cat-quechers-m.webp 512w, /assets/img/products/cat-quechers-l.webp 720w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 48vw, 100vw" width="720" height="540" alt="QuEChERS extraction and sample preparation workflow" loading="lazy">
    </div>

    <div class="home-solution-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Featured solution</p>
      <h2 id="solution-title">Reliable analytical solutions for demanding applications.</h2>
      <p>From rapid intake screening to chromatography-ready sample prep, our products support routine testing across food safety, pharmaceutical and industrial labs.</p>
      <ul class="home-solution-list">
        <li>QuEChERS and dSPE workflows</li>
        <li>Instrument-ready sample prep</li>
        <li>Support for method-matched product selection</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/solutions/food-testing-labs/">Explore Solutions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

