    </div>
    <p class="home-section-copy">Reliable analytical products across diverse industries, helping maintain quality, compliance and safety.</p>

    <div class="home-industry-grid">
      <article class="home-industry-card">
        <img src="/assets/img/products/cat-quechers-m.webp" width="700" height="520" alt="Food testing lab sample preparation" loading="lazy">
        <div class="home-industry-body">
          <p class="kicker">Food testing labs</p>
          <h3>Food testing labs</h3>
          <p>Matched products for method-driven contaminant and residue analysis.</p>
          <a href="/solutions/food-testing-labs/">Explore {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="home-industry-card">
        <img src="/assets/img/products/cat-antibiotic-residues-m.webp" width="700" height="520" alt="Dairy processor analytical testing" loading="lazy">
        <div class="home-industry-body">
          <p class="kicker">Dairy processors</p>
          <h3>Dairy processors</h3>
          <p>Fast screening for residues, adulterants and collection-point quality checks.</p>
          <a href="/solutions/dairy/">Explore {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="home-industry-card">
        <img src="/assets/img/products/cat-mycotoxins-m.webp" width="700" height="520" alt="Feed and poultry testing products" loading="lazy">
        <div class="home-industry-body">
          <p class="kicker">Feed and poultry</p>
          <h3>Feed and poultry</h3>
          <p>Routine screening and contamination control from intake to finished feed.</p>
          <a href="/solutions/feed-and-poultry/">Explore {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="home-industry-card">
        <img src="/assets/img/products/cat-filtration-m.webp" width="700" height="520" alt="Industrial analytical filtration" loading="lazy">
        <div class="home-industry-body">
          <p class="kicker">Industrial &amp; chemical</p>
          <h3>Industrial &amp; chemical</h3>
          <p>Robust consumables and filtration support for analytical workflows.</p>
          <a href="/products/filtration/">Explore {% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

